	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『GUNDAM FACTORY YOKOHAMA』の動く実物大ガンダムのオリジナル商品。チタニウムフィニッシュを施した特別仕様で登場！",
			"• チタニウムフィニッシュ加工を施した高級感溢れる仕上がり",
			"• 歩行、右腕上げ、両腕あげなど動くガンダムの挙動を再現できる可動域！",
			"• 動くガンダム「RX-78F00」のディティール、カラーリングを徹底再現",
			"• ライフル、シールドが付属"
		],
		"en": [
			"An original moving life-sized Gundam product from \"GUNDAM FACTORY YOKOHAMA\". Introducing a special specification with titanium finish!",
			"• Luxury finish with titanium finish processing",
			"• Range of motion that allows you to reproduce Gundam's movements such as walking, raising the right arm, raising both arms, etc.!",
			"• Thorough reproduction of the details and coloring of the moving Gundam \"RX-78F00\"",
			"• Rifle and Seal included"
		]
